1.Description

   Enhanced the overall homepage user interface by improving visual consistency, typography, spacing, color palette, component styling, and responsive behavior. The primary objective of this implementation was to create a clean, modern, and healthcare-focused user experience that aligns with industry-standard pharmacy and healthcare websites.

   The homepage was redesigned with improved visual hierarchy, better readability, consistent spacing, modern card layouts, and optimized interactive elements to provide a premium browsing experience for users across all devices.

2.Business Requirement

   The initial homepage layout provided the required functionality but lacked a polished and professional appearance. The business required a visually appealing interface that would:

    Improve customer trust.
    Enhance brand identity.
    Increase user engagement.
    Improve content readability.
    Create a modern healthcare website experience.
    Ensure consistent UI components throughout the homepage.
    Support responsive layouts across all devices.

